@startuml Departure

title A convoy departs only when every blocking requirement holds
caption Target design. Decisions O36, P4, O3, P9, O7, P11, D35, P8, O4. ADR 0008.

autonumber

actor Dispatcher as disp
participant "Freedom API" as api
participant "Readiness\n(pure function)" as ready
database "Freedom database" as db

disp -> api : POST /convoys/{id}/depart
api -> db : load the facts: leader, crew, insurance, ferry,\nhandover Receivers, allocations, box validation,\nReceiver status, declarations, accommodation, budget
api -> ready : assess(facts, as of now)
ready --> api : requirements (scope, state, owner, severity, link)

alt any blocking requirement unmet
  api --> disp : **409** with each unmet requirement and where to fix it
  note right of disp
    Convoy: leader assigned; accommodation (or self-arranged)
    for every crew member at every overnight stop.
    Each vehicle: at least one driver; insurance in cover and
    covering every driver; ferry booked; handover Receiver
    registered; every box attested with a registered Receiver;
    declarations current.
  end note
  note right of api
    There is no override, waiver or "depart anyway" for any role (O3).
  end note
else all blocking requirements met
  api -> db : Convoy.DepartedAt (conditional: only once)
  api --> disp : departed, with any advisory warnings
end

disp -> api : POST /convoys/{id}/depart (again)
api --> disp : 409, already departed

@enduml
